150: /// An optional future that yields [Poll::Pending] when [None]. Useful within `select!` macros,
151: /// where a future may be conditionally present.
152: ///
153: /// Not to be confused with [futures::future::OptionFuture], which resolves to [None] immediately
154: /// when the inner future is `None`.
